# the keys are the scale: toggles, the root stays, three notes at least; modes and the root
wait 300
# A Aeolian (Hypnos): A B C D E F G. F#3 is key 1: add F#
tapkey 1
expect pool 1197
tapkey 1
expect pool 1709
# key 9 is D4: out of the scale
tapkey 9
expect pool 1677
# the next mode: Phrygian
turn ALGO 1
expect par72 2
expect pool 1451
turn ALGO -1
expect pool 1709
# the root up a tone (Global page, KNOB 1): B
tap GLO
spin K1 2
expect par71 11
tap HOME
expect pool 1709
wait 300
shot b_aeolian.png
# pentatonic minor, then strip it down to three notes and try a fourth removal
turn ALGO 6
expect par72 7
expect pool 1193
# E pent min: E G A B D. Remove G (key 2 = G3) and A (key 4 = A3)
tapkey 2
tapkey 4
expect pool 425
# B (key 6): would leave two
tapkey 6
expect pool 425
wait 300
shot three.png
# MIDI in, channel 1: A (note 57) back in
midi 90 39 64
wait 20
expect pool 1449
# the scale is not saved: the kit is untouched
expect dirty 0
